# Dev Toolbox build-time options. Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) for local use;
# production values live in GitHub → Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions → Variables.
#
# Optional cookie-free page-view counting. Leave everything unset (the default) to build
# without analytics. See README.md → "Analytics (optional, off by default)".
#
# VITE_ANALYTICS_PROVIDER=goatcounter
# VITE_ANALYTICS_GOATCOUNTER_SITE=your-site-code
#
# Self-hosted GoatCounter: give the full https /count endpoint instead of a site code.
# VITE_ANALYTICS_ENDPOINT=https://stats.example.com/count
